cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "CoHiKer++: LLM-based fault localization and repair for the Linux kernel"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible artifact for contrastive-reasoning fault localization (BGE-M3
  dense retrieval over a case-level semantic knowledge base plus a golden-patch
  knowledge base) combined with a LangGraph multi-agent repair pipeline that
  generates, applies and validates kernel patches in QEMU.
